                <head><hi rendition="#small-caps">Editor’s Note</hi></head>
                <p>—At the morning meeting of the Foreign Ministers (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >ante</hi>, page 145) it was agreed that they would meet at 3:45 p.m. The
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Rapporteur’s</hi> report (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >ante</hi>, page 158) indicates that the meeting was actually held, but no
                    minutes therefor have been found.</p>
            </div>
